> > limited swiotlb buffer bool.  dma_direct_alloc (which in 4.17 is also
> > used for x86) already has a GFP_DMA fallback, so extending this for
> > GFP_DMA32 as well would seem reasonable.
> > 
> > Any volunteers?
> 
